rooms_desc ({"This is the main entrance to a most wonderful house.The walls are lines with pictures.  This room is carpeted wall to wall.There is a mat at the entrance with a rack next to it.Here you feel the need to relax and leave your worries at the door.Remember you are a guest, so be kind to your host.Enjoy your visit!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!","This room is very clean.  In the center is a large table.  On the east wall is a picture window.  A tea cart sits in the soutwest corner.  Inthe northwest corner rests a cabinet.  This room is neat and clean, pleasedon't make a mess.","This room is decorated with rose colored wallpaper.There is a bed with a printed comforter and a teddy bear on top.Next to the bed is a large bookcase with gem stones on top.Along the west wall is a closest, which might contain something.If you are in this room you must be special.","Are your teeth floating?  Are your eye balls turning yellow?If so, this potty is a relief for you.  In this room, there is aa potty, a sink, and a rather large bathtub.  The floor is patternedceramic tile.  Near the tub is a shower rug.","This is a comfortalbe room.  There is a small sofa along thesouth wall with a small coffee table in front of it.  On bothsides of the sofa are end tables, which have matching lamps ontop.  Next to the door rests a television and vcr.Sit and rest a while.","The walls are covered with bookcases filled with book.  Along the northwall is a desk with an IBM computer on top.  There is a sofa near the east wall.","Come in and grab a snack.  Along the east wall is a fridge, a stove,a sink, and a lovely counter.  The counter continues along the southwall.  In the southwest corner is a table with a basket on top.  Thereis a pantry in the northwest corner.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Welcome to Saffrin's house!!!!!!!","Saffrin's Dining Room","Saffrin's bedroom!","Saffrin's Potty","Saffrin's living room","Saffrin' Study","Saffrin's Kitchen",0,0,0,})
