items ({({"rack","a rack to hang your coat and hat on","carpet","A dark green carpet.","mat","A welcome mat","pictures","pictures of Saffrin's family",}),({"dog","A beige cocker spaniel named Duchess","china","cream colored china with rose print","cabinet","A large oak cabinet filled with china","garden","There are tomatos, peppers, zucchini, eggplants, squash, and basil.","window","You see a large garden and a dog","mirror","You see yourself, smile.","tea cart","An oka tea cart with a large mirror above","table","A large oak table that seats six",}),({"bed","A bed with a rose print comforter on top.  Ther is a teddy bear here.","bear","This is Saffrin's special teddy bear, Cedric.","bookcase","A bookcase filled with sciene fiction and romance novels.","stones","Gems of all sorts: emeralds, diamonds, alexandrites, moldivites.  Look.","emerald","A dark green beryl.  Brings: love, kindness, healing, patience","diamond","A carbon based gem.  Brings: innocence, purity, faithfulness, abundance","alexandrite","A color changing chrysoberyl.  Brings: Joy, oneness with life","moldivite","A green meteorite found only in the Vltava River basin.","closet","Don't peek at Saffrin's undergarments, a nice guest shouldn't do that.",}),({"legs","The bath tub jumps and does a brief tap dance.",}),({"vcr","a box with buttons","television","showing \"Mystery Science Theatre 3000\" all day long","lamps","brass lamps with white shades","end tables","cedar tables with magazines on top","magazines","Cosmopolitian, Premire, TVGuide, Time","cosmopolitian","a beauty magazine","time","a news magazine","premire","","premire","a film magazine","magazines","cosmopolitian, time, premire, tvguide, lapidary-journal","tvguide","a television magazine","lapidary-journal","a geology magazine on gems and fossils","sofa","a cream colored sofa with rose print","coffee table","a hundred year old table. Don't put you feet on it!!!!!!!",}),0,({"fridge","Filled with Diet Coke, vitiams, and leftovers","diet coke","white can, red letters","vitiams","A,B,C,D,E, iron, calcium, and centrim","leftovers","fajitas, homemade turkey rice soup, pizza","stove","there is a large pot on the burner","pot","smell the homemade marinara souce","basket","filled with banannas, apples, oranges, and grapes","sink","oops, someone left a dirty dish here, don't look","counter","here is a toaster and coffee machine","toaster","get some poptarts and have breakfast","coffee machine","mmmmmmm......fresh coffee","table","a table that seats six","pnatry","p","pantry","filled with pasta, soup cans, potatoes, onions, and spices",}),0,0,0,})
